<title>USA: Allergan sees intense competition.</title>
<headline>Allergan sees intense competition.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allergan Inc said it continues to experience intense competition across its principal product lines, primarily generic competition for certain pharmaceutical products.</p>
<p>It said it is also experiencing continued pricing pressures from government and private managed care sources and expects these trends to continue. It also said it continues to pursue aggressive investment strategies.</p>
</text>
